<title>JAPAN: S'tomo Life 96/97 bad loan disposals at Y560 bln.</title>
<headline>S'tomo Life 96/97 bad loan disposals at Y560 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Life Insurance Co said on Monday it had disposed of some 560 billion yen worth of problem loans in the business year which ended on March 31 and had thereby cut such loans to a manageable level.</p>
<p>A senior company official told reporters that Sumitomo Life used profits from the sale of property and securities to dispose of the problem loans during the year.</p>
<p>&quot;We have reduced them (problem loans) to a manageable level,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
